WEBVTT

00:01:28.071 --> 00:01:30.721
Not one of them can tell me
why this stuff is so cool,

00:01:30.745 --> 00:01:32.078
why it's so important.

00:01:34.237 --> 00:01:36.157
I'm totally clueless.

00:01:36.181 --> 00:01:38.776
I have no idea what to do next.

00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:42.363
So the only thing I can think of is say,

00:01:42.387 --> 00:01:45.077
"Listen. Let me tell you a story.

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:52.331
The main characters in the story
are bacteria and viruses.

00:01:52.355 --> 00:01:55.157
These guys are blown up
a couple million times.

00:01:55.831 --> 00:01:58.973
The real bacteria and viruses are so small

00:01:58.997 --> 00:02:01.251
we can't see them without a microscope,